    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d332-a1">

                <pb facs="0792" n="708" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg708"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 280.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jackson to Mr. Mariscal.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 30,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: By telegram received from the Secretary of
                    State, at Washington, I am informed that Francisco Arresures, an American
                    citizen, was delivered, upon requisition, to the authorities of Mexico,
                    notwithstanding his American citizenship, by a Texan magistrate; that the
                    American consul at Piedras Negras made demand upon the former for his return,
                    which was refused, and by their order the said Francispo Arresures was taken
                    from jail and shot.</p>
                <pb facs="0793" n="709" xml:id="pg709"/>
                <p>I regret that I cannot specify dates and places of the delivery, demand, and
                    killing. It will suffice, however, to say that the occurrences are very recent,
                    and must have been in the close vicinage of Piedras Negras.</p>
                <p>I am instructed by my Government to ask that a prompt investigation may be made
                    of them, and that should they expose a case of violence, the criminals may be
                    brought to justice.</p>
                <p>It gives me pleasure to renew, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>HENRY R. JACKSON.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
